59. Data Minimization Update
Authoro should avoid becoming an unnecessary warehouse of sensitive material.
Prefer storing:
* document hashes
* issuer attestations
* aggregate telemetry
* signed evidence
* external references
over:
* full raw keystroke logs
* government ID scans
* private deleted text
* complete third-party documents
When raw evidence must exist, retention controls should be explicit.

